; MoneyDancer 2.0 — XAUUSD STEP + S2.C.8 Daily Pre-Close Flatten (PRECLOSE ship)
; Date: 2026-05-22 — pending H2 OOS validation before promotion to default
;
; Same as XAUUSD_2.0_STEP_ship.set except:
;   DailyPreCloseHour=22                  (was 0 = OFF)
;   DailyPreCloseMinute=0                 (cutoff right before trading-window end 22:10)
;   DailyResumeHour=1                     (resume next morning at 01:00 server)
;   DailyPreCloseLossThresholdPct=6.0     (only close baskets at >=6% equity floating loss)
;
; The threshold catches baskets within 2pp of basket-SL trigger (8%) — i.e.,
; baskets effectively about to SL anyway, BUT pre-empted before the XAU
; daily-break window denies the close. Healthy baskets transient dips don't
; reach -6%, so monsters preserved.
;
; H1 17-cell sweep result (this config vs STEP_ship):
;   Total profit: $86,034 vs STEP $82,110 (+$3,924 / +4.8%)
;   Positive cells: 16/17 (same — feb25 still negative but less)
;   Max DD: 38.14% (vs 37.79% STEP, +0.35pp — feb25-H1, the only neg cell)
;   7 cells materially improved: apr25 +12pp, may25 +14pp, sep25 +10pp,
;     oct25 +8pp, dec25 +9pp, may26 +27pp, jan26 +4pp
;   0 regressions > 20pp
;   8 cells unchanged (flatten never fired — basket-PL never hit -6%)
;
; Sample at may25-H2 (THE 40.48% breach cell from STEP H2 OOS):
;   DD 40.48% → 26.7% ✓ — breach gone
;   Net +128.8% → +132.3% ✓ — net IMPROVED, not just safer
;
; Why this works:
;   - 22:00 cutoff is BEFORE the broker's XAU daily-break window (~23:00-01:00 UTC)
;   - 6% threshold ≈ basket-SL/2 — only catches deeply underwater baskets
;   - Monster cell baskets (apr26, mar26 etc.) transient dips < 6% — unaffected
;   - Bleeding baskets already past -6% at 22:00 → closed BEFORE basket-SL rail
;     gets denied by market-closed status in the daily-break window
;
; Rails unchanged from STEP:
;   S1.0 basket-SL (8% cap, 2/day pause) | S1.5 auto-lots (LotsBasePerThousand=0.002)
;   S1.6 all-time DD (40% trailing kill) | S1.7 Friday flatten (20:00)
;   S3.2a MMD multi-cloud regime (HARD)  | S3.2b WITH_TREND-only (RegimeTrendMode=1)
;   S2.C.3 STEP knobs (StepPoints=80, MinOrderDistancePts=60)
;   S2.C.8 daily pre-close (NEW)

